<title>ALBANIA: Albanian May CPI rises 1.04 pct m/m, 31.95 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Albanian May CPI rises 1.04 pct m/m, 31.95 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following main economic indicator on Tuesday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION		MAY 97     APRIL 97     MAY 96</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)     + 1.04     - 1.53	 + 1.0</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	  +31.95     +31.94	 + 8.4</p>
<p> Index (Dec 93 base=100)	175.06     173.26	 132.66</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom, +355-42-29825</p>
</text>
